> 
> ### Name: rayplot3D_scatter
> ### Title: Interactive 3D scatter plot (experimental)
> ### Aliases: rayplot3D_scatter rayplot3D_close
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> ## Not run: 
> ##D h <- rayplot3D_scatter(
> ##D   CO2$conc, CO2$uptake, as.numeric(CO2$Treatment),
> ##D   point_radius = 0.1
> ##D )
> ##D 
> ##D rayplot3D_close(h)
> ## End(Not run)
